# Identity Echo's ability is "Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 307.1): Bot1 leaves a Mountain and three Moxen untapped
# after turn 1, enough for {3}{R}, and during Bot2's turn 2 the ability is refused (Bot1 has priority, but it is not Bot1's
# main phase). On turn 3, in Bot1's own main phase with an empty stack, the same activation is offered and resolves:
# the Ornithopter is exiled and the first creature revealed (Llanowar Elves, behind a Forest) enters.

